papers/67-multiplicative-plaquette-matroid-complexity/stage3/EDITORIAL_SYNTHESIS.md:27:The panel finds the manuscript methodologically rigorous, domain-accurate, argumentatively coherent, cross-disciplinarily legible, well structured, and capable of supporting its bounded field-general contribution claim. The Methodology and DA cards both support the definition-to-classification chain from coprime-root coordinates and the mixed-difference equation through the vertex-potential image, graph rank, cycle constraints, Haar dependence, and the two finite-geometry counting laws. The Domain and EIC cards likewise recognize the all-finite-shape graphic-matroid organization as the paper's conceptual center while crediting the manuscript's careful refusal to relabel finite pattern-growth rates as dynamical entropy.
